[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Akvorado is installed. It requires external Kafka and ClickHouse services.

Copy the sample configuration files into place and update the Kafka and
ClickHouse addresses before starting any services:

  for f in akvorado.yaml console.yaml inlet.yaml outlet.yaml; do
    cp %%ETCDIR%%/$f.sample %%ETCDIR%%/$f
  done

The rc.d services are disabled by default. Enable the services you need in
/etc/rc.conf. Start the orchestrator before inlet, outlet and console.

For additional information, see %%DOCSDIR%%/README.md.
EOM
}
]